sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Benutzer
    participant Debugger
    participant CPU
    participant Memory
    participant Screen

    User->>Debugger: Step/Continue
    Debugger->>CPU: Debug-Command
    CPU->>Memory: Fetch Instruction / Read
    Memory-->>CPU: Instruction/Data
    CPU->>Memory: Write (optional)
    CPU->>Screen: Render Output
    Screen-->>User: Display
    CPU-->>Debugger: Register/Status
    Debugger-->>User: Update UI/State
